[{"title":"臬司索和半洲戡黎二首 其一","author":"黄衷","text":"不孤南徼倚长城，已试胸中数万兵。\n云鸟尽从丹旆转，风霆端向彩毫生。\n千山笳鼓馀悲壮，列郡山河总廓清。\n为问磨崖高几许，伏波那得擅前名。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":56834,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"臬司索和半洲戡黎二首 其二","author":"黄衷","text":"晨驰露檄到江城，琼管先春报罢兵。\n蜃气更无台观起，鲸波真见縠纹生。\n桃根犊戏绿莎净，桑上鸮音白昼清。\n自昔均劳惟将相，不妨儒化并威名。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":56835,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"郡中复索和二首 其一","author":"黄衷","text":"百雉遥遥海上城，万艘飞渡信神兵。\n涛声总挟风威壮，杀气先占月晕生。\n三令军牙多算在，群山蛮落一时清。\n淩烟今日还图画，笑认南征节镇名。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":56836,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"郡中复索和二首 其二","author":"黄衷","text":"南纪晨衙拥百城，东山安石旧能兵。\n唐功黄峒迂裴使，汉议朱崖陋贾生。\n蔀屋已无遗虎患，沧溟应为见龙清。\n雅歌一曲油幢暇，横槊何人浪得名。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":56837,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"壬寅牡丹再花期丫山南皋同赏二首 其一","author":"黄衷","text":"十载衡门下，三回力病看。\n谩劳誇富贵，直爱谢高寒。\n约蕊金丝净，披钿彩缬单。\n岭南无此品，不道种时难。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":56838,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"壬寅牡丹再花期丫山南皋同赏二首 其二","author":"黄衷","text":"双萼骄清晓，虚庭却耐看。\n挈瓶聊小润，张幄为轻寒。\n纵兴杯先满，迎暄袂欲单。\n玩芳仍具美，谁谓盍簪难。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":56839,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵翁梦山与徐芝南登观音山","author":"黄衷","text":"台省群英集，春山二妙徂。\n望深青嶂眇，兴极紫云孤。\n悦韵迁莺早，奇标振鹭馀。\n自堪欣丽景，谁更问清都。\n羽客丁归鹤，诗人郑鹧鸪。\n行歌三月里，瑶草着花无。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":56840,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送除芝南少参入贺","author":"黄衷","text":"有时山海见麟游，恰兆人龙起越州。\n一道霜严持斧使，列城风动富民侯。\n声歌肯后齐天祝，酺宴仍先玩月秋。\n抱病送君成远梦，谩随呼舞殿东头。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":56841,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送翁梦山大佥还治所","author":"黄衷","text":"委巷春先淡，衡门午未开。\n我缘多病卧，君以所闻来。\n凤德灵阳耀，珠光合浦回。\n清文祛俗韵，英抱济时才。\n望海心弥泰，观风化已该。\n交人安远堠，池盗怖轰雷。\n书带青萦砌，诗筒碧映台。\n狂谈知不厌，佳气满蒿莱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":56842,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"青虫","author":"黄衷","text":"么么粘着短墙幽，群动营营一掉头。\n日出化为蝴蝶舞，前身疑汝是庄周。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":56843,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"缘螺","author":"黄衷","text":"雨馀三两出柔桑，一壳乾坤有底光。\n掷向坭涂才缩首，几曾真解决行藏。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":56844,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"蝉","author":"黄衷","text":"风露生涯也自便，林塘消暑日长天。\n悠然一枕羲皇上，恼杀残声落耳边。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":56845,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"蝇虎","author":"黄衷","text":"雕墙画栋得横行，青背红头敢自营。\n净几经时无黑白，老予真幸尔为生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":56846,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"螗螂","author":"黄衷","text":"绿阴还翳化时衣，生息曾堪讽后妃。\n休向鸣蝉频怒臂，个中黄雀正交飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":56847,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"蜻蛉","author":"黄衷","text":"水乡长是晚天繁，青紫纷纷各羽翰。\n莫厌飞虫逐香腐，小儿池上把黏竿。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":56848,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"蚱蜢","author":"黄衷","text":"江东时托阜螽名，柔翅脩胫捷且轻。\n好向长林饱风雾，主人嫌汝夜来声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":56849,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"蟋蟀","author":"黄衷","text":"露下清秋韵正哀，斗场元在画堂开。\n眼前军国成何事，且博红妆一笑来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":56850,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"白鱼","author":"黄衷","text":"质却纤柔害却多，牙签堆里托巢窠。\n名山秘府俱残缺，万顷香芸奈尔何。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":56851,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"蟢子","author":"黄衷","text":"屋角柔丝吐复收，谄夫于汝是同流。\n无端又报林间喜，不道闲人更隐忧。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":56852,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"挽毅斋黄奉常","author":"黄衷","text":"作善宜家庆，脩名乃物灾。\n文章留谏苑，礼乐盛容台。\n老切宗盟恋，俄兴国士哀。\n与施钦义举，论驳识风裁。\n气郁金茎露，标清绿萼梅。\n不张初度宴，可御永辞杯。\n讣入天心恻，恩加谕奠来。\n白头歌楚些，云日亦低回。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":56853,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"邹贞妇词","author":"黄衷","text":"柏舟泛泛即平生，破镜犹含古月晶。\n糜椀丰年仍菜色，绩灯寒夜且虫声。\n穷愁不折乾坤气，慈节终悬岭海名。\n谁道丈夫持世教，白头曾见五朝卿。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":56854,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"中秋对月和南皋","author":"黄衷","text":"月妙岂今夕，秋芳眷此时。\n迎凉疑露重，抚事感星移。\n伫立银桥映，闻歌绣户披。\n澄光弥覆载，灵魄浴涟漪。\n鸾舞宜香藉，仙居总赤墀。\n檐虚虫语近，地迥漏声迟。\n葛履霜应戒，筠帘夜不垂。\n环词先有作，可客旧难期。\n老爱坡翁放，谁堪宋玉悲。\n东明犹倚望，西堕似睽离。\n白石空千载，黄湾自一涯。\n分庭仍共赏，乐意肯相差。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":56855,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送侯三峰宪长赴贵州左辖次梦山兵宪韵","author":"黄衷","text":"才名来省署，江汉共汤汤。\n棠荫池阳茇，兵分赣上行。\n粤乡风自正，蜀道颂宁忘。\n引旆星阶直，乘轺轸野长。\n百蛮归煦煦，千骑拥堂堂。\n英略齐方叔，清芬挹沈郎。\n通衔藩左辖，举武殿东廊。\n贵竹连襄岘，流芳与继羊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":56856,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"再赠三峰","author":"黄衷","text":"满林梧竹弄秋声，芳菊岐亭未放英。\n霜晓楼船迎度雁，山城衙鼓报迁莺。\n九霄戎马抡才日，一道琴书入省程。\n野客江湖还伏枕，停云歌动不胜情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":56857,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"南皋就医寄以二绝句 其一","author":"黄衷","text":"梁鸿不见忽经时，独把清秋寄竹枝。\n闻道书床披素问，岐黄应有洗心医。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":56858,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"南皋就医寄以二绝句 其二","author":"黄衷","text":"街头无菊斗残芳，惊眼梅花恰满霜。\n老子西林三两树，期君长为恼花光。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":56859,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"读南皋玩菊赋","author":"黄衷","text":"南皋起海澨，灏气沦长庚。\n冲襟戢时彩，古水渟清泓。\n遗我玩菊赋，净宇流商声。\n一奏天地肃，馀音泛洪鐄。\n自匪金石资，安悦高秋英。\n风丝谢五柳，去日皆劳生。\n霜霰集阶序，蟋蟀居前楹。\n旅怀感黄落，君独振璁珩。\n我有一亩宫，佳色参差明。\n对临但噤默，讵为减芳情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":56860,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"读南皋冬日郊行赋","author":"黄衷","text":"纪叙戒南景，吾土尚幽美。\n野柽绿辞叶，涧草缀寒蘤。\n巾车骛近郊，引瞩宛百里。\n陂陀亘如濯，我仆罢挥泚。\n森松韵风簧，泉冷逗芳乳。\n晨晖且欣欣，逸迹况几几。\n杜陵振古豪，策蹇逐桃李。\n何如觅戴翁，雪棹剡溪涘。\n蛇虺蛰未固，豺虎纷向市。\n幸君遄其旋，阴飙暮方驶。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":56861,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"丫山惠菊酒霜橘豚蹄口占奉谢二首 其一","author":"黄衷","text":"绿樽传惠到寒堂，潋滟真含琥珀光。\n洗盏悠然还独酌，尘襟无限九秋芳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":56862,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"丫山惠菊酒霜橘豚蹄口占奉谢二首 其二","author":"黄衷","text":"皇橘醑翁映二毛，春风长日读离骚。\n老饕意态凭描画，细嚼豚蹄当左螯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":56863,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"矩洲篇","author":"黄衷","text":"早岁艳时誉，镂悰铁砚规。\n春风辞绛帐，夜月映书帷。\n长啸闻苍昊，清吟动碧漪。\n碧漪浩浩接南溟，几欲乘涛淩太清。\n豪鲸妖蜃肆光怪，皓兔朱乌失晦明。\n敛柁回樯厌渺漫，重崖复巘寻真伴。\n橘中壶里各乾坤，麟脯龙根充列馔。\n上界真人开玉宇，运斗调元临下土。\n巨川名岳召仙才，驱摄雷霆簸云雨。\n玄功洽九垓，涓滴沦枯莽。\n驾凤骖鸾附壮游，谁知蒲柳暗惊秋。\n霞裾雾縠馀光彩，野性终教恋矩洲。\n矩洲之上一亩宫，蒋生三径偶然同。\n匏悬未见来双燕，离立还堪荫四松。\n随山馆弄水轩情，知不及辟疆园宁。\n须更置平泉，石但拟人称。\n角里村沙际，春归望帝悲。\n夏阴时爱啭黄鹂，留人短柮煨山芋，祛暑双鬟剥水芝。\n御柳亭亭摇翠葆，海棠蕊吐缠丝瑙。\n移科旋觉蜡梅生，照影将期苍桧老。\n薜茑敷岩疑叆叇，杜蘅芳结幽贞佩。\n扶桑素艳斗红妆，斑蠡游苗如列队。\n榴缀霜房锦贝披，杨梅小绀杏酸时。\n伤霖恨褪绯樱实，妨帽先删刺柘枝。\n荔熟繁星森赤赪，芭蕉倚日青罗扇。\n篱收薏苡琲筐盈，架绾蒲萄珠几丳。\n雄李肤腴绿蕴丹，密云羊枣弄金丸。\n柑垂佛手虫丝罥，罗望来禽茧粒残。\n枸杞子，决明花，露葵香菌旧浑家。\n瓷瓶净注黄梨液，石火新烹苦茗芽。\n拂袂清风不可攀，衡门昼倩白云关。\n潆泂练带寒江外，缥缈芙蓉夕照间。\n鹤莎足认溪边路，草艇横桥烟火暮。\n粉绘徒传处士居，郊墟谩揭高人步。\n五经掩壁空便腹，战蚁虚床罢蕉鹿。\n远梦游吴访石头，因之适越登天目。\n天目峥嵘惬大观，循溪曲曲发荃兰。\n烟岚足底从生没，丘壑胸中自屈蟠。\n桃叶舞，竹枝歌，矩洲之上乐如何。\n卷舒无亦閒踪迹，鹏翼蝇须若个多。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":56864,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵答南皋","author":"黄衷","text":"青阳淑气爽，物候几恒冬。\n归燕未入户，独叟惟深恫。\n短褐昼瑟缩，炊炉晨未红。\n江乡谅如此，岂必大块同。\n美人渺南郭，孤抱方逵鸿。\n长林足泥淖，何以延清风。\n时芳羡三月，譬日忽已中。\n君尚理药裹，予安辞固穷。\n逃虚者谁氏，曲肱盻高桐。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":56865,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"七十自寿","author":"黄衷","text":"排日携觞报客过，衡门谁道可张罗。\n医师不治缘书癖，符笔鸡降只睡魔。\n宿雾早迷红药渡，炎风时动翠菱波。\n莫辞私□□顽叟，七十人间浪笑歌。","collection":"明","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":56866,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"九日","author":"黄衷","text":"九日闲林少物华，独携灵寿向山家。\n丹枫总下纷纷叶，黄菊犹含灿灿花。\n去燕影连先到雁，回牛背点晚归鸦。\n颠云倒月人生态，落帽何烦笑孟嘉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":56867,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和柯狮山大参山中十二景 其一 金兑储精","author":"黄衷","text":"池阳郁郁大江隅，近拥金陵势夐殊。\n灵秀总输狮子岭，元精应为异贤储。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":56868,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和柯狮山大参山中十二景 其二 珠毬孕秀","author":"黄衷","text":"彤云长爱护毬峰，神女游珠雅自同。\n我欲御风横铁笛，弄高山月答歌钟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":56869,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和柯狮山大参山中十二景 其三 灵芝兆祥","author":"黄衷","text":"芳菲何限竞春先，唯有芝英俟庆妍。\n闻道贵池连帅府，一年三秀锦堂前。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":56870,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和柯狮山大参山中十二景 其四 赤光腾彩","author":"黄衷","text":"清门佳气发祥时，冲斗笼烟似晓曦。\n树德从来叶天道，不烦詹尹更稽疑。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":56871,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和柯狮山大参山中十二景 其五 一溪环碧","author":"黄衷","text":"滉漾澄秋月一围，溪花隐约淡朝晖。\n临流偶纵知鱼乐，露湿金光草叶衣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":56872,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和柯狮山大参山中十二景 其六 群峰送青","author":"黄衷","text":"江上兹山与岳尊，腾猿回鹤谩纷纷。\n帘端矗矗群峰翠，一笑真同列戟分。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":56873,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和柯狮山大参山中十二景 其七 泉琴风弄","author":"黄衷","text":"明珠迸落玉盘深，松叶翻涛度远林。\n一奏未终天地白，人间徒想洞庭音。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":56874,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和柯狮山大参山中十二景 其八 几石云封","author":"黄衷","text":"蜀客休誇石镜平，巨灵亲置白云庭。\n老龙化作髯翁坐，呼吸雷风寂不惊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":56875,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和柯狮山大参山中十二景 其九 枫林晚照","author":"黄衷","text":"一夜江南少女霜，枫飘丹叶满斜阳。\n儿童不信秋容晚，却道青山也艳妆。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":56876,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和柯狮山大参山中十二景 其十 槐砌午阴","author":"黄衷","text":"草堂曾咏古楸凉，几席频随野老忙。\n何似面槐传胜事，主人名位近丞郎。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":56877,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和柯狮山大参山中十二景 其十一 枌榆古杜","author":"黄衷","text":"滴酒刲牲社令前，当时冠玉最英年。\n枌榆阴净将箫鼓，好是江南燕子天。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":56878,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和柯狮山大参山中十二景 其十二 松竹别庄","author":"黄衷","text":"茅屋鸡声隔短墙，手栽松竹看分行。\n久要我自怜清韵，风入长林广乐张。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":56879,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"即事","author":"黄衷","text":"榕阴满地净芳尘，别岸残花为送春。\n芳草十年风咏客，闲窗今日昼眠人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":56880,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"月溪寺","author":"黄衷","text":"东望乔林即翠微，鹧鸪分草引雏飞。\n狮峰象岭对幽寂，月出钟鸣僧未归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":56881,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"矩洲杂咏五十首 其一","author":"黄衷","text":"融春行药石桥东，憔悴形容即漫翁。\n事事不如彭泽宰，四株疏柳约东风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":56882,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"矩洲杂咏五十首 其二","author":"黄衷","text":"清晓凝寒午郁蒸，幽居何处兴堪乘。\n东岩闻有栖禅侣，欲扣云关恨未能。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":56883,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"矩洲杂咏五十首 其三","author":"黄衷","text":"委巷微通老圃家，墙隅几树欲蒸霞。\n落红犹自因风舞，不是榴花是槿花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":56884,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"矩洲杂咏五十首 其四","author":"黄衷","text":"回塘漠漠旋成桥，寒窦长回小尽潮。\n溪老似谙幽寂性，一蓑烟雨送鱼苗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":56885,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"矩洲杂咏五十首 其五","author":"黄衷","text":"瘦仆长镵薙短莎，一弓荒土种波罗。\n牙根木爱甜如蜜，只为秾阴入夏多。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":56886,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"矩洲杂咏五十首 其六","author":"黄衷","text":"自是园林只着闲，雁声虚带凤城寒。\n粤王台上曾回首，不见云山见雪山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":56887,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"矩洲杂咏五十首 其七","author":"黄衷","text":"竹外逢人常不冠，溪方愚号谷方盘。\n五风十雨浑闲计，记得三回赏牡丹。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":56888,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"矩洲杂咏五十首 其八","author":"黄衷","text":"老大生涯任拙谋，家儿叫噪为观优。\n梁尘飞尽空肠断，总有西山月映楼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":56889,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"矩洲杂咏五十首 其九","author":"黄衷","text":"古木交阴水漫川，野人相对石床眠。\n幸抛旧梦谈新梦，莫问悬车今几年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":56890,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"矩洲杂咏五十首 其十","author":"黄衷","text":"嬉谐长笑不能棋，坐向林塘撚素髭。\n爱杀饥鹰轻且捷，衔鱼飞上木绵枝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":56891,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"矩洲杂咏五十首 其十一","author":"黄衷","text":"偶从琴客订幽期，紫荇春寒未引丝。\n新水魿鱼堪作鲙，山庖急为捣橙齑。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":56892,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"矩洲杂咏五十首 其十二","author":"黄衷","text":"木绵衫薄快春晴，橘酒微醺不作酲。\n月上疏林堪散步，村娃何处斗歌声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":56893,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"矩洲杂咏五十首 其十三","author":"黄衷","text":"张公说易著西铭，逸气言从见猎生。\n忆昨少年□易甚，射鹰飞鞚出江城。","collection":"明","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":56894,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"矩洲杂咏五十首 其十四","author":"黄衷","text":"右军挥洒谪仙歌，总有驯鹇似白鹅。\n芳玩未应疑放达，风流文藻古无多。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":56895,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"矩洲杂咏五十首 其十五","author":"黄衷","text":"渔人晨网集寒塘，赪尾苍鳞总是伤。\n不见大鱼乘浪去，五湖风雨正茫茫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":56896,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"矩洲杂咏五十首 其十六","author":"黄衷","text":"冬郊香雪破梅花，春郊桃蘤烂晨霞。\n病叟清狂销不得，倩人扶起踏晴沙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":56897,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"矩洲杂咏五十首 其十七","author":"黄衷","text":"委羽山人厌腐腥，自收松蕊贮山瓶。\n寄来不惮三千里，病骨长沾玉露馨。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":56898,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"矩洲杂咏五十首 其十八","author":"黄衷","text":"有客晨携桂酒香，山瓢引满劝先尝。\n请君尽酌休辞醉，一滴能捐鬓脚霜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":56899,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}}]